{
    "title": "Black Deck - Card Battle CCG",
    "description": "Fend off the forces of evil in ferocious card battles. Test your skills in combat and build your roster of heroes in this epic turn-based collectable card game with original core gameplay that\u2019s <b> easy to learn but fiendishly difficult to master.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udd2eFEATURES\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udd2e:</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>190+ beautifully designed cards</b> featuring fascinating characters from 10 different factions. Find and equip hundreds of powerful artifacts to improve your power.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Explore a stunning <b>fantasy world</b> with a beautiful map and over 300 stages.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Fight the full gamut of evil forces in magic duels</b> \u2694\ufe0f with 48 Epic Bosses or enter the PvP arena to do card battle with other RPG enthusiasts.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Battle your way</b> through 7 Dungeons featuring dangerous Titans to ensure you\u2019re never lacking an exciting challenge.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<b>Ascend the monster-filled levels of the Treasure Tower</b> with traps, powerups, and rich rewards behind every draw.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<b>Cool artwork of compelling heroes</b> \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f and fearsome foes, plus eye-catching animation to enhance your trading card adventures.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<b>Myriad other enhancements and features</b> including autoplay to help you speed through campaigns, daily rewards to augment your trading card collection, and regular tournaments to challenge yourself against the world.\r\n\r\nDangerous monsters, undead hordes and terrible demons \ud83d\udc79 are on the rise! Only you stand between the massed forces of evil and the total devastation of this beautiful fantasy world. \r\n\r\n<u>Gather your heroes  and start your epic adventure in this turn-based RPG that\u2019s guaranteed to thrill fans of strategic card games.</u>\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fend off the forces of evil in ferocious card battles. Test your skills in combat and build your roster of heroes in this epic turn-based collectable card game with original core gameplay that\u2019s <b> easy to learn but fiendishly difficult to master.</b><br><br><b>\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udd2eFEATURES\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udd2e:</b><br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>190+ beautifully designed cards</b> featuring fascinating characters from 10 different factions. Find and equip hundreds of powerful artifacts to improve your power.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 Explore a stunning <b>fantasy world</b> with a beautiful map and over 300 stages.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>Fight the full gamut of evil forces in magic duels</b> \u2694\ufe0f with 48 Epic Bosses or enter the PvP arena to do card battle with other RPG enthusiasts.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>Battle your way</b> through 7 Dungeons featuring dangerous Titans to ensure you\u2019re never lacking an exciting challenge.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<b>Ascend the monster-filled levels of the Treasure Tower</b> with traps, powerups, and rich rewards behind every draw.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<b>Cool artwork of compelling heroes</b> \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f and fearsome foes, plus eye-catching animation to enhance your trading card adventures.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<b>Myriad other enhancements and features</b> including autoplay to help you speed through campaigns, daily rewards to augment your trading card collection, and regular tournaments to challenge yourself against the world.<br><br>Dangerous monsters, undead hordes and terrible demons \ud83d\udc79 are on the rise! Only you stand between the massed forces of evil and the total devastation of this beautiful fantasy world. <br><br><u>Gather your heroes  and start your epic adventure in this turn-based RPG that\u2019s guaranteed to thrill fans of strategic card games.</u><br><br>Privacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy<br>Terms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use",
